</li>
 	<li>
<p class="zw-list zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-left="0.5in" data-text-indent="-0.25in" data-margin-bottom="0pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2" data-list-id="22045075" data-list-info="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;22045075&quot;,&quot;l&quot;:0}">Tarefas conectadas a reuniões, documentos, cronogramas e conversas com o cliente</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-bottom="12pt" data-margin-top="12pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2">Tudo acontece com fluidez. Tudo está onde deve estar. Tudo é escalável.</p>

<h3 class="zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-bottom="12pt" data-margin-top="12pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2">Quais são os 3 tipos de gestão?</h3>
<ol data-list-id="49794165" data-list-format="{&quot;level5&quot;:{&quot;c&quot;:&quot;\u0005.&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:2,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level4&quot;:{&quot;c&quot;:&quot;\u0004.&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:4,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level7&quot;:{&quot;c&quot;:&quot;\u0007.&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:4,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level6&quot;:{&quot;c&quot;:&quot;\u0006.&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:0,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level8&quot;:{&quot;c&quot;:&quot;\b.&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:2,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level1&quot;:{&quot;c&quot;:&quot;\u0001.&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:4,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level0&quot;:{&quot;c&quot;:&quot;\u0000.&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:0,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level3&quot;:{&quot;c&quot;:&quot;\u0003.&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:0,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level2&quot;:{&quot;c&quot;:&quot;\u0002.&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:2,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1}}" data-spl-bullet-format="{}">
 	<li>
<p class="zw-list zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-left="0.5in" data-text-indent="-0.25in" data-margin-bottom="0pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2" data-list-id="49794165" data-list-info="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;49794165&quot;,&quot;l&quot;:0}">Gestão Operacional – Foco na execução de tarefas, rotinas e procedimentos.</p>
</li>
 	<li>
<p class="zw-list zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-left="0.5in" data-text-indent="-0.25in" data-margin-bottom="0pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2" data-list-id="49794165" data-list-info="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;49794165&quot;,&quot;l&quot;:0}">Gestão Tática – Coordena equipes e alinha a execução com os objetivos estratégicos.</p>
</li>
 	<li>
<p class="zw-list zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-left="0.5in" data-text-indent="-0.25in" data-margin-bottom="0pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2" data-list-id="49794165" data-list-info="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;49794165&quot;,&quot;l&quot;:0}"><a href="https://orbitgestao.com.br" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Gestão Estratégica</a> – Define metas, visão de longo prazo e direciona a empresa para o crescimento.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p class="zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-bottom="12pt" data-margin-top="12pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2">O Evolutto integra esses três níveis dentro da plataforma, permitindo que o consultor atue com foco estratégico, acompanhe a execução tática e tenha clareza operacional, tudo em um só lugar.</p>

<h3 class="zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-bottom="12pt" data-margin-top="12pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2">Quais são as 4 <a href="/blog/troque-5-ferramentas-pelo-evolutto-mais-eficiencia-para-consultorias-em-uma-unica-plataforma">ferramentas</a> de gestão?</h3>
